{
  "dom_id": "step-e13126",
  "name": "Example: Determining Whether a Table Represents a Proportional Relationship",
  "problem": "Martha is running low on cupcakes, so she decides to make some more. The amount of time $h$ (in hours) she spends baking and the number of cupcakes $c$ she makes are shown in the table below.\n\n| Hours $(h)$ | Cupcakes $(c)$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $2$ | $5$ |\n| $3$ | $7$ |\n| $4$ | $9$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. There is a proportional relationship between $c$ and $h.$\n\nII. There is **not** a proportional relationship between $c$ and $h.$\n\nIII. The constant of proportionality is $\\dfrac{9}{2}.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's add a new column to our table and compute the ratio of cupcakes per hour for each row.\n\n| Hours $(h)$ | Cupcakes $(c)$ | Cupcakes / Hours |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $2$ | $5$ | $\\dfrac 5 2$ |\n| $3$ | $7$ | $\\dfrac 7 3$ |\n| $4$ | $9$ | $\\dfrac 9 4$ |\n\nThe ratio of cupcakes per hour is not the same for each row. Therefore, there is *not* a proportional relationship between $c$ and $h.$ Consequently, there is no constant of proportionality.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e13126\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Determining Whether a Table Represents a Proportional Relationship</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e13126\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage *